    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FLIGHTTIMES\nand News of the Port\nMarch 1, 1991\nSan Diego International Airport\nLindbergh Field\nTravelers are reminded that skycap service is still\navailable curbside at Lindbergh Field. Although curbside\ncheck-in service is no longer provided due to increased\nsecurity procedures imposed by the Federal Aviation\nAdministration (FAA), skycaps may unload luggage from\nvehicles curbside and transport the baggage to ticket coun-\nters in the terminals where it will be checked in. See\nadditional information inside.\nSchedule Information Contained Herein\nIs Subject To Change By The Airlines.\nPlease Consult Your Airline\nFor Further Information."
    ],
